  <!-- EN: Terrible -->
  <VME_CeremonialSuicideRitualOutcome.outcomeChances.0.label>Terrível</VME_CeremonialSuicideRitualOutcome.outcomeChances.0.label>
  <!-- EN: The {0} was terrible! The blade was thrust laterally and there was blood and entrails everywhere. Disgusting! -->
  <VME_CeremonialSuicideRitualOutcome.outcomeChances.0.description>O(a) {0} foi terrível! A lâmina entrou de lado, e havia sangue e entranhas por toda parte. Nojento!</VME_CeremonialSuicideRitualOutcome.outcomeChances.0.description>
  <!-- EN: Boring -->
  <VME_CeremonialSuicideRitualOutcome.outcomeChances.1.label>Chata</VME_CeremonialSuicideRitualOutcome.outcomeChances.1.label>
  <!-- EN: The {0} was boring. The speech seemed forced. At the very least we have restored the honor of our colony. -->
  <VME_CeremonialSuicideRitualOutcome.outcomeChances.1.description>O(a) {0} foi chato(a). O discurso pareceu forçado. Pelo menos restauramos a honra da colônia.</VME_CeremonialSuicideRitualOutcome.outcomeChances.1.description>
  <!-- EN: Honorable -->
  <VME_CeremonialSuicideRitualOutcome.outcomeChances.2.label>Honrosa</VME_CeremonialSuicideRitualOutcome.outcomeChances.2.label>
  <!-- EN: The {0} has restored the honor of our colony. The shadow of defeat no longer clouds our minds. -->
  <VME_CeremonialSuicideRitualOutcome.outcomeChances.2.description>O(a) {0} restaurou a honra da colônia. A sombra da derrota não nubla mais nossas mentes.</VME_CeremonialSuicideRitualOutcome.outcomeChances.2.description>
  <!-- EN: Unforgettable -->
  <VME_CeremonialSuicideRitualOutcome.outcomeChances.3.label>Inesquecível</VME_CeremonialSuicideRitualOutcome.outcomeChances.3.label>
  <!-- EN: The {0} was unforgettable! Everyone will remember the courage, self-control, and strong resolve. The honor of our colony is now spotless. -->
  <VME_CeremonialSuicideRitualOutcome.outcomeChances.3.description>O(a) {0} foi inesquecível! Todos vão lembrar da coragem, do autocontrole e da firmeza. A honra da colônia agora está imaculada.</VME_CeremonialSuicideRitualOutcome.outcomeChances.3.description>
